    "label": "boolean-dfs-helper",
    "code": "import java.util.*;\n\nclass Solution {\n    public boolean subsetSumExists(int[] nums, int target) {\n        return dfs(nums, 0, target);\n    }\n\n    private boolean dfs(int[] nums, int index, int remaining) {\n        if (remaining == 0) {\n            return true;\n        }\n        if (index == nums.length || remaining < 0) {\n            return false;\n        }\n        return dfs(nums, index + 1, remaining - nums[index]) || dfs(nums, index + 1, remaining);\n    }\n}\n",
    "notes": "Uses a helper recursion that checks take and skip branches with a running remainder.",
